{%- comment -%}
  The hero's play button: a burgundy disc in the middle of the hero, the film's name and length in the hero's gold
  eyebrow type under it (Oriol 2026-11-04: "el play button en el centro del video", as on Meridian). The hero itself is
  the film's poster: a click anywhere on it plays the film (assets/bizmis-film.js). Params: label (the translation key
  of the button's name), length (the film's length, optional), inline (true: the phones' twin, in the copy's flow under
  the heading; the centred one is the desktop's).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign label = label | t -%}
<button type="button" class="hero-film-play{% if inline %} hero-film-play--inline{% endif %}" data-film-open aria-label="{{ label }}{% if length != blank %} ({{ length | escape }}){% endif %}">
  <span class="hero-film-play__disc" data-play aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="hero-film-play__ring"></span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"/></svg>
  </span>
  <span class="hero-film-play__label" aria-hidden="true">
    {{- label -}}
    {%- if length != blank %}<span class="hero-film-play__length">{{ length }}</span>{% endif -%}
  </span>
</button>
